Dialogue: 2,0:23:09.07,0:23:13.33,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,520)\c&H502532&\t(10,1520,\c&H4E081C&)\t(1521,2140,\c&H651727&)\t(2141,3300,\c&H6C382A&)\t(3301,3960,\c&H4C2D2B&)\t(3961,4470,\c&H4F3939&)\t(4471,5530,\c&H6C382A&)\t(5531,6320,\c&H651727&)\t(6321,7100,\c&H4C2D2B&)}わたし良いとこないよ
Dialogue: 2,0:23:13.33,0:23:18.23,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,520)\c&H502532&\t(10,1520,\c&H4E081C&)\t(1521,2140,\c&H651727&)\t(2141,3300,\c&H6C382A&)\t(3301,3960,\c&H4C2D2B&)\t(3961,4470,\c&H4F3939&)\t(4471,5530,\c&H6C382A&)\t(5531,6320,\c&H651727&)\t(6321,7100,\c&H4C2D2B&)}好き…(すき…)嫌い…(きらい…)　わかんないけど
Dialogue: 2,0:23:18.46,0:23:23.59,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,520)\c&H502532&\t(10,1520,\c&H4E081C&)\t(1521,2140,\c&H651727&)\t(2141,3300,\c&H6C382A&)\t(3301,3960,\c&H4C2D2B&)\t(3961,4470,\c&H4F3939&)\t(4471,5530,\c&H6C382A&)\t(5531,6320,\c&H651727&)\t(6321,7100,\c&H4C2D2B&)}心拍バグってる　君のせい
Dialogue: 2,0:23:23.59,0:23:30.30,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,520)\c&H502532&\t(10,1520,\c&H4E081C&)\t(1521,2140,\c&H651727&)\t(2141,3300,\c&H6C382A&)\t(3301,3960,\c&H4C2D2B&)\t(3961,4470,\c&H4F3939&)\t(4471,5530,\c&H6C382A&)\t(5531,6320,\c&H651727&)\t(6321,7100,\c&H4C2D2B&)}普通の恋じゃなくても　綺麗じゃなくても
Dialogue: 2,0:23:30.30,0:23:34.76,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,520)\c&H502532&\t(10,1520,\c&H4E081C&)\t(1521,2140,\c&H651727&)\t(2141,3300,\c&H6C382A&)\t(3301,3960,\c&H4C2D2B&)\t(3961,4470,\c&H4F3939&)\t(4471,5530,\c&H6C382A&)\t(5531,6320,\c&H651727&)\t(6321,7100,\c&H4C2D2B&)}自分らしく それでいいじゃん
Dialogue: 2,0:23:34.76,0:23:42.40,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,520)\c&H502532&\t(10,1520,\c&H4E081C&)\t(1521,2140,\c&H651727&)\t(2141,3300,\c&H6C382A&)\t(3301,3960,\c&H4C2D2B&)\t(3961,4470,\c&H4F3939&)\t(4471,5530,\c&H6C382A&)\t(5531,6320,\c&H651727&)\t(6321,7100,\c&H4C2D2B&)}不器用でも届けたい想いがあるの
